{"product_id":"harry-and-the-bucketful-of-dinosaurs-9-books","title":"Harry and the Bucketful of Dinosaurs 9 Books","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"223\" data-end=\"500\"\u003eStep into the magical world of Harry and his six toy dinosaurs—Taury, Trike, Patsy, Pterence, Sid, and Steggy. With a single jump into his bucket, Harry brings his dinosaurs to life, and together they embark on wild, fun-filled adventures that spark imagination and laughter.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"993\"\u003eThis special collection of 9 enchanting stories follows Harry and his dinosaur friends through snow-covered kingdoms, messy swamps, exciting school days, museum mysteries, and even a heartwarming Christmas wish. From stomping through puddles to learning lessons about friendship, curiosity, and courage, every story is packed with humor, adventure, and heart. Young readers will love joining Harry on every thrilling journey, and parents will enjoy watching their imaginations take flight.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1025\"\u003eIncluded in this collection:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1377\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1026\" data-end=\"1066\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1028\" data-end=\"1066\"\u003eHarry and the Bucketful of Dinosaurs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1067\" data-end=\"1094\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1094\"\u003eHarry and the Snow King\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1095\" data-end=\"1135\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1135\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Go to School\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1181\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1138\" data-end=\"1181\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Romp in the Swamp\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1182\" data-end=\"1223\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1223\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Make a Splash\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1224\" data-end=\"1260\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1260\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Say Raah\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1261\" data-end=\"1302\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1263\" data-end=\"1302\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs in the Museum\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1303\" data-end=\"1327\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1327\"\u003eHarry and the Robots\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1377\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1377\"\u003eHarry and the Dinosaurs Make a Christmas Wish\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1379\" data-end=\"1580\"\u003ePerfect for children aged 4-8, this collection is ideal for bedtime stories, classroom reading, or anytime young readers want to explore a world where toys come to life and every day is an adventure.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1603\" data-end=\"1624\"\u003eAuthor: Ian Whybrow\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1627\" data-end=\"1657\"\u003eIllustrator: Adrian Reynolds\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1660\" data-end=\"1707\"\u003eFormat: Paperback \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1710\" data-end=\"1738\"\u003ePages: Approx. 32 per book\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1763\"\u003eAge Range: 4-8 years\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1763\"\u003eISBN: \u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45803742167193,"sku":"13RA8765432","price":180.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_38cd1cd3-0695-4058-8026-e9e7aba44245.jpg?v=1760810108","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/harry-and-the-bucketful-of-dinosaurs-9-books","provid